        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Does Foresight allow Visionary to switch the die on her card for one rolled for movement during a player&#39;s&nbsp;<em>To Be Continued</em>?<br />&nbsp;</p><p>I can see the ruling being that the target is not the one making this roll, so the wording on the card would not apply; however, with the example of The Operative&#39;s <em>Dragon&#39;s Frenzy&nbsp;</em>specifying attack and defence rolls, I would think the lack of that type of specific wording on Foresight would mean movement (the only other type of roll so far) would also be a roll that can be manipulated.<br /><br />Apologies if this has been answered elsewhere, I couldn&#39;t find it...</p>",
